[28.354857, "o", "0000032 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  >................<\r\n*\r\n0003904 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 16 0a 04 00 21 07 74  >.............!.t<\r\n0003920 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 39 3f e0 00 00 00 00 00  >estword09?......<\r\n0003936 00 16 09 04 00 21 07 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30  >.....!.testword0<\r\n0003952 38 40 58 ff 5c 28 f5 c2 8f 0f 08 04 00 21 01 74  >8@X.\\(.......!.t<\r\n0003968 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 37 63 0f 07 04 00 21 01  >estword07c....!.<\r\n0003984 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 36 4b 0f 06 04 00 21  >testword06K....!<\r\n0004000 01 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 35 32 0f 05 04 00  >.testword052....<\r\n0004016 21 01 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 34 2a 0f 04 04  >!.testword04*...<\r\n0004032 00 21 01 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 33 19 0f 03  >.!.testword03...<\r\n0004048 04 00 21 01 74 65 73 74 77 6f 72 64 30 32 0a 0f  >..!.testword02..<"]
